IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sg-proc-register-access`

-- Tests for sg-proc-register-access.l4 (s 12(2)(d), s 192(3) and (4), s 196A(1) and (5): the procedure for the register of members).
-- Every expected outcome below was written from the text (src:2809-2830, 17248-17265, 17447-17450, 17512-17516 of CoA1967.txt) before the module was run,
-- never copied from its output. A trace that does not match is a finding. Day 0 of each trace is the day the TIMELINE line above its rule names.

§ `The number of days to the last day for sending the copy`

-- 21 days commencing on the day next after the day of receipt: the 21st day after receipt, and 35 with a further 14 days.
#ASSERT `s 192(3) the number of days from the receipt of the request to the last day for sending the copy` (Date 1 3 2026) 0 EQUALS 21
#ASSERT `s 192(3) the number of days from the receipt of the request to the last day for sending the copy` (Date 1 3 2026) 14 EQUALS 35
#ASSERT `s 192(3) the number of days from the receipt of the request to the last day for sending the copy` (Date 15 2 2028) 0 EQUALS 21
#ASSERT `s 192(3) the number of days from the receipt of the request to the last day for sending the copy` (Date 31 12 2026) 7 EQUALS 28

§ `s 12(2)(d): the person obtains a copy of or an extract from the electronic register of members`

-- Arguments: the person; the prescribed fee has been paid; the register is the electronic register of members of a private company kept under s 196A;
-- the company is one the Minister has specified under (2A), the notification not cancelled; the notification was cancelled and the document was filed before the cancellation.

-- No time limit: the person obtains the copy early.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 12(2)(d) the person may obtain a copy of or an extract from the electronic register of members once the prescribed fee is paid` (Individual "P") TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "P" DOES `s 12(2)(d) obtain a copy of or an extract from the electronic register of members of the private company` AT 5

-- No time limit: the person obtains the copy a year later, and it is still in order.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 12(2)(d) the person may obtain a copy of or an extract from the electronic register of members once the prescribed fee is paid` (Individual "P") TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "P" DOES `s 12(2)(d) obtain a copy of or an extract from the electronic register of members of the private company` AT 400

-- A person who never asks has done nothing wrong: the permission stays open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 12(2)(d) the person may obtain a copy of or an extract from the electronic register of members once the prescribed fee is paid` (Individual "P") TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

-- Gate fails: the prescribed fee has not been paid; the text grants access "on payment of the prescribed fee", so nothing arises.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 12(2)(d) the person may obtain a copy of or an extract from the electronic register of members once the prescribed fee is paid` (Individual "P") FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

-- Gate fails: the company is one the Minister has specified under (2A): subsection (2)(d) does not apply.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 12(2)(d) the person may obtain a copy of or an extract from the electronic register of members once the prescribed fee is paid` (Individual "P") TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

-- Gate fails: the notification was cancelled, and the document was filed before the cancellation (2B): (2)(d) does not apply to it.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 12(2)(d) the person may obtain a copy of or an extract from the electronic register of members once the prescribed fee is paid` (Individual "P") TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

-- Gate fails: the register in question is not the electronic register of members of a private company.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 12(2)(d) the person may obtain a copy of or an extract from the electronic register of members once the prescribed fee is paid` (Individual "P") TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

§ `s 192(3) and (4): the public company sends the copy within 21 days`

-- Arguments: the person; the name of the company; the part requested relates only to names, addresses, number of shares held and amounts paid;
-- the sum required in advance for every page, in dollars; the day the company receives the request; the further days the Registrar considers reasonable (0 if none).

-- In time: the copy is sent on day 10.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 192(3) the person may ask the public company for a copy of the register and the company must send it within the period` (Individual "P") "A Co" TRUE 1 (Date 1 3 2026) 0 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "P" DOES `s 192(3) ask the public company for a copy of the register of members` AT 0
    PARTY Company "A Co" DOES `s 192(3) send the person the copy of the register that was asked for` AT 10

-- The last day: 21 days commencing on the day next after receipt (1 March), so 22 March, which is day 21.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 192(3) the person may ask the public company for a copy of the register and the company must send it within the period` (Individual "P") "A Co" TRUE 1 (Date 1 3 2026) 0 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "P" DOES `s 192(3) ask the public company for a copy of the register of members` AT 0
    PARTY Company "A Co" DOES `s 192(3) send the person the copy of the register that was asked for` AT 21

-- After the last day: the copy is sent on day 22, outside the 21 days: the company has not sent it "within a period of 21 days".
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 192(3) the person may ask the public company for a copy of the register and the company must send it within the period` (Individual "P") "A Co" TRUE 1 (Date 1 3 2026) 0 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "P" DOES `s 192(3) ask the public company for a copy of the register of members` AT 0
    PARTY Company "A Co" DOES `s 192(3) send the person the copy of the register that was asked for` AT 22

-- Nothing is sent and the 21 days run out.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 192(3) the person may ask the public company for a copy of the register and the company must send it within the period` (Individual "P") "A Co" TRUE 1 (Date 1 3 2026) 0 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "P" DOES `s 192(3) ask the public company for a copy of the register of members` AT 0
    (WAITUNTIL 22)

-- Nothing is sent yet and the 21 days have not run out: the duty is still open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 192(3) the person may ask the public company for a copy of the register and the company must send it within the period` (Individual "P") "A Co" TRUE 1 (Date 1 3 2026) 0 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "P" DOES `s 192(3) ask the public company for a copy of the register of members` AT 0
    (WAITUNTIL 10)

-- No request has been made: the permission to ask stays open and the company owes nothing.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 192(3) the person may ask the public company for a copy of the register and the company must send it within the period` (Individual "P") "A Co" TRUE 1 (Date 1 3 2026) 0 AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

-- A further period of 14 days, as the Registrar considers reasonable: day 30 is in time.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 192(3) the person may ask the public company for a copy of the register and the company must send it within the period` (Individual "P") "A Co" TRUE 1 (Date 1 3 2026) 14 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "P" DOES `s 192(3) ask the public company for a copy of the register of members` AT 0
    PARTY Company "A Co" DOES `s 192(3) send the person the copy of the register that was asked for` AT 30

-- With a further 14 days the last day is day 35; day 36 is late.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 192(3) the person may ask the public company for a copy of the register and the company must send it within the period` (Individual "P") "A Co" TRUE 1 (Date 1 3 2026) 14 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "P" DOES `s 192(3) ask the public company for a copy of the register of members` AT 0
    PARTY Company "A Co" DOES `s 192(3) send the person the copy of the register that was asked for` AT 36

-- With no further period, day 30 is late.
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 192(3) the person may ask the public company for a copy of the register and the company must send it within the period` (Individual "P") "A Co" TRUE 1 (Date 1 3 2026) 0 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "P" DOES `s 192(3) ask the public company for a copy of the register of members` AT 0
    PARTY Company "A Co" DOES `s 192(3) send the person the copy of the register that was asked for` AT 30

-- Gate fails: the part requested goes beyond names, addresses, number of shares held and amounts paid; no duty to send arises.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 192(3) the person may ask the public company for a copy of the register and the company must send it within the period` (Individual "P") "A Co" FALSE 1 (Date 1 3 2026) 0 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "P" DOES `s 192(3) ask the public company for a copy of the register of members` AT 0
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

-- Gate fails: the company asks for more than $1 a page in advance; the sum is not one the subsection allows.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 192(3) the person may ask the public company for a copy of the register and the company must send it within the period` (Individual "P") "A Co" TRUE 2 (Date 1 3 2026) 0 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "P" DOES `s 192(3) ask the public company for a copy of the register of members` AT 0
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

§ `s 196A(1): the Registrar keeps and maintains the electronic register`

-- Arguments: the company is a private company; the date asked.

-- The duty has no time limit: done on day 5.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 196A(1) the Registrar must keep and maintain an electronic register of members, as a standing duty` TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 196A(1) the Registrar keeps and maintains the electronic register of members of the private company` AT 5

-- The text sets no last day: nothing done yet leaves the duty open, never a breach.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 196A(1) the Registrar must keep and maintain an electronic register of members, as a standing duty` TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

-- Gate fails: the company is not a private company.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 196A(1) the Registrar must keep and maintain an electronic register of members, as a standing duty` FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

-- Gate fails: the date asked is before 3 January 2016, and the duty runs "On and after 3 January 2016".
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 196A(1) the Registrar must keep and maintain an electronic register of members, as a standing duty` TRUE (Date 1 12 2015) AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

§ `s 196A(5): the Registrar updates the electronic register`

-- Arguments: the change is lodged under one of the listed provisions; the change is required or authorised by another provision to be lodged.

-- No time limit: the Registrar updates on day 3.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 196A(5) the Registrar must update the electronic register of members for a change lodged, as a standing duty` TRUE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Registrar DOES `s 196A(5) the Registrar updates the electronic register of members for the change lodged` AT 3

-- The change was authorised to be lodged by another provision of the Act: the duty arises, and is still open.
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 196A(5) the Registrar must update the electronic register of members for a change lodged, as a standing duty` FALSE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

-- Gate fails: a change lodged under no provision of the Act; the text says nothing.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 196A(5) the Registrar must update the electronic register of members for a change lodged, as a standing duty` FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 400)

-- READS-DIFFERENTLY-ON-MAIN:
--   None by outcome class. All 25 traces above give the same class (FULFILLED, BREACH or RESIDUAL) on the stable build (cache entry 112) as on the unstable build (20261125, a50cbd0).
--   One difference of print only: a still-open MAY is laid out on one line by the unstable build and on three lines by the stable build.
